e code 发现了很方便 只需要@就ok了 . 再然后我又发现了sub agent概念 .现在有点模糊的是 课程的 multi agent 和 sub agent他们的区别是什么","like_count":2,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1521002,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/35/6a/7997de5a.jpg","nickname":"晓寒","note":"","ucode":"8BB0F59591B8CC","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":682136,"discussion_content":"sub agent是multi agent的一种组织形式。multi-agent就是多智能体，但具体多个智能体如何协作要看后面的组织范式。其中一种分层模式，就是一个经理指挥一群小弟agent干活的，里面的小弟agnet就是sub agent。除了分层模式，还会有分工串行的顺序模式，或者讨论模式之类的","content_length":350,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1773122853,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1622448,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/18/c1/b0/b52d9ade.jpg","nickname":"苏彧","note":"","ucode":"C016B28DF7449C","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":682307,"discussion_content":"这个@功能是什么呢，我现在也遇到了这样的场景，上游改了，下游想同步修改","content_length":103,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1773388872,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"浙江","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":405792,"user_name":"不矫情不做作那是我","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1093407,"ip_address":"安徽","ucode":"C735CEEB01EF23","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/af/1f/cb324542.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1772942623,"is_pvip":false,"repl